sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Administrator (Dashboard)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SEC as require_api_key
    participant REPO as detection_repo
    participant FS as uploads/ (JSON + JPG)
    participant DB as Supabase

    A->>API: GET /api/v1/detections?status=pending&min_confidence=0
    API->>REPO: get_all_detections(min_conf, limit, status)
    REPO->>FS: read _MOCK_STORE, filter, sort created_at DESC
    REPO-->>API: rows
    API-->>A: 200 list of detections

    A->>API: GET /api/v1/images/{id}
    API->>REPO: get_image_file_path(id)
    API-->>A: image/jpeg (FileResponse)

    A->>API: PATCH /api/v1/detections/{id}/status {status: fixed}
    API->>REPO: update_detection_status(id, status)
    REPO->>REPO: invalid status coerced to confirmed
    REPO->>REPO: get_detection_by_id(id)
    alt not found
        API-->>A: 404 Detection not found
    else found
        opt Supabase configured
            REPO->>DB: UPDATE status WHERE id
        end
        REPO->>FS: save record + JSON
        API-->>A: 200 updated record
    end

    A->>API: DELETE /api/v1/detections/{id} + X-API-Key
    API->>SEC: verify key
    alt invalid key
        SEC-->>A: 401
    end
    API->>REPO: delete_detection(id)
    REPO->>FS: remove from store, rewrite JSON
    opt Supabase configured
        REPO->>DB: DELETE WHERE id
    end
    REPO->>FS: os.remove({id}.jpg)
    REPO-->>API: True (always)
    API-->>A: 200 {deleted: id}
